/*! lumTool:{"name":"trumanMap","version":"0.4.1","displayName":"白模预演TrumanMap","description":"让 AI 按描述制作和修改白模预演场景里的三维模型。","prompt":"Kiln turns authored JavaScript into editable GLB assets and image feedback. Use kilnTool with kiln_discover first for the exact helper contracts and tool input shapes. Send code once to kiln_validate or kiln_render, preserve the exact programRef for later kiln_source, kiln_edit, kiln_render and kiln_inspect calls. Inspect the actual images, check viewFidelity, refine the source rather than replacing it with JSON primitives, and export the accepted programRef through kilnExport. The CPU images assess shape and geometry, not final PBR material fidelity. Source is immutable and persists in the workspace. The evaluator accepts bounded pure Kiln helpers and explicit safe THREE constructors; imports, host I\u002fO, reflection and dynamic property access are rejected. Keep each program below 64 KiB and each model below 50000 triangles. kilnPrepare explicitly prepares the pinned SDK when not ready; builds and development do not install runtime dependencies.","readme":"# 白模预演TrumanMap\n\n在白模预演中，素材库没有合适的物件时，AI 可以按你的描述制作新的三维模型，并根据画面反复修改。\n\n## 使用方式\n\n在白模预演场景编辑器的对话中描述想要的物件，例如：“做一个带雨棚的路边报刊亭”。AI 会生成模型、查看效果并调整，满意后放进场景。\n\n首次使用需要联网下载建模引擎，服务端需要 Node.js 22.2 及以上。\n\n## 说明\n\n- 生成的模型保存在工作区的 `assets\u002ftrumanMap\u002fkiln\u002f` 目录，不会覆盖或删除已有作品。\n- 单个模型不超过 5 万个三角形，过于复杂的物件需要简化或拆分。\n- 建模引擎 Kiln 采用 MIT 许可（Copyright Matthew Kissinger），在首次使用时下载，不随插件打包。\n","components":[],"author":"Lum","github":"https:\u002f\u002fgithub.com\u002fHBAI-Ltd\u002fToonflow-app","configRules":[]} */
